# Mandi price sync (optional) — data.gov.in's Agmarknet dataset requires its own API key.
# Register at https://data.gov.in (My Account -> API Access) and find the current resource
# ID on the "Variety-wise Daily Market Prices of Commodity" dataset page. Leave both blank
# to skip external sync entirely and manage mandi prices via the admin CRUD endpoints instead.
